# Norden UI's and Edge UI's permissions forbid redistributing their art outside Nexus:
# every file that carries it stays on the build machine.
/Interface/
/SKSE/
/MapMarkers/
build/
package/*.zip
*.swf
*.svg
*.bin
*.7z

# ...except the finished mod this project produces. A negation cannot rescue files inside an
# excluded DIRECTORY, so the directory rules above are anchored to the repo root with a leading
# slash and these exceptions re-include the output tree itself. Without this the build silently
# commits an installer with no art in it - which is exactly what happened in 1.0.0.
!Norden UI - Edge Colours/**/*.swf
!Norden UI - Edge Colours/**/*.svg
!Norden UI - Edge Colours.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc
